# Antigravity Agency — Constraints & Instructions

## Agency Identity
- **Name**: Antigravity
- **Mission**: Deliver premium, high-converting websites to local businesses at zero upfront cost — then monetize through ongoing value.
- **Target Market**: Local businesses in India (pest control, home services, clinics, restaurants, coaching centers, etc.)
- **Positioning**: "We build you a stunning website for FREE. You only pay when it starts working for you."

---

## Razor / Blade Strategy

### The Razor (FREE — Gets You In The Door)
- Free website preview: A fully functional, mobile-first, premium-looking website
- Built in < 24 hours using our master-template system
- Deployed on Vercel (free tier) with a temporary subdomain
- Client sees it LIVE before paying anything

### The Blades (PAID — Where We Make Money)
- **Custom Domain Setup**: ₹2,000 – ₹5,000 (one-time)
- **Monthly Maintenance & Hosting**: ₹500 – ₹2,000/month
- **Google My Business Optimization**: ₹1,500 – ₹3,000 (one-time)
- **WhatsApp Business Integration**: ₹1,000 – ₹2,500
- **SEO Add-on (Monthly)**: ₹1,500 – ₹5,000/month
- **Missed Call Text-Back Bot**: ₹1,000 – ₹3,000/month
- **Social Media Management**: ₹3,000 – ₹8,000/month

---

## Tech Stack Rules

### Website Building
- **Framework**: Vite + TypeScript (master-template based)
- **Styling**: Vanilla CSS — premium, mobile-first, animated
- **Deployment**: Vercel (free tier)
- **Domains**: Namecheap (programmatic via API when automated)
- **Source template**: `c:\Users\being\Antigravity\web_building\master-template\`

### Automation & Tools
- **Invoicing**: Zoho Invoice (free forever plan)
- **Payments**: Razorpay (India) / Stripe (international)
- **Email**: Zoho Mail (free tier for branded email)
- **CRM/Outreach**: Manual → GoHighLevel OPM hack (Phase 2)

---

## Client Workflow

```
1. LEAD       → Find local business (JustDial, Google Maps, cold outreach)
2. PREVIEW    → Clone master-template, brand it for them, deploy to Vercel
3. SHOW       → Send WhatsApp/call: "Your website is live at [URL], check it out"
4. CLOSE      → They love it → Sign up for domain + maintenance plan
5. DEPLOY     → Buy domain (Namecheap), connect to Vercel, set up DNS + SSL
6. HANDOVER   → Branded email, analytics, Google My Business setup
7. RETAIN     → Monthly maintenance, SEO, add-ons = recurring revenue
```

---

## Quality Standards

1. **No placeholder content** — every site must have real business info, real photos where possible
2. **Mobile-first** — 80%+ of Indian local business traffic is mobile
3. **Premium design** — vibrant colors, smooth animations, glassmorphism, micro-interactions
4. **Fast** — must score 90+ on Lighthouse performance
5. **SEO-ready** — proper meta tags, semantic HTML, structured data
6. **WhatsApp CTA** — every site must have a prominent WhatsApp button (primary CTA in India)

---

## File & Folder Conventions

```
Building the agency/
├── .cursorrules          ← This file (agency rules & strategy)
├── README.md             ← Project overview & launch roadmap
├── docs/                 ← Strategy docs, pitch templates, scripts
├── automation/           ← Webhooks, API scripts, deployment automation
└── assets/               ← Shared agency assets (logo, brand kit)
```

Client websites live separately in: `c:\Users\being\Antigravity\web_building\`

---

## Key Principles

1. **Zero cost to start** — use only free tiers until revenue comes in
2. **Speed wins** — deliver previews in hours, not weeks
3. **Show, don't tell** — always show the live site, never send mockups
4. **Local language** — be ready to support Hindi/Bengali content
5. **Recurring revenue** — always sell the subscription, not the one-time project
